[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16803.27, "timestamp": "04:40:03", "text": "东西。嗯。太多了。就像我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16806.47, "timestamp": "04:40:06", "text": "我会说，嗯，这对大家都好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16807.91, "timestamp": "04:40:07", "text": "即使对我来说，以前也比现在好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16810.15, "timestamp": "04:40:10", "text": "我亲自体验过。你越喜欢你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16813.75, "timestamp": "04:40:13", "text": "学习越多，探索越多。所以是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16816.15, "timestamp": "04:40:16", "text": "最好是，比如说，你想成为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16818.47, "timestamp": "04:40:18", "text": "一位新晋 YouTuber。现在我会说是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16820.59, "timestamp": "04:40:20", "text": "你最好还是自己去探索一下。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16823.67, "timestamp": "04:40:23", "text": "你自己。学习方法请访问 YouTube"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16825.708, "timestamp": "04:40:25", "text": "搜索每一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16828.788, "timestamp": "04:40:28", "text": "网站就像教你如何做这些事情一样，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16830.868, "timestamp": "04:40:30", "text": "如何才能成功等等。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16832.788, "timestamp": "04:40:32", "text": "你会找到解决办法的，你会……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16835.07, "timestamp": "04:40:35", "text": "能够做到。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16838.788, "timestamp": "04:40:38", "text": "嗯——说到这个，我刚刚"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16841.51, "timestamp": "04:40:41", "text": "想起了我第一次见到他的情景"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16844.788, "timestamp": "04:40:44", "text": "我想你的模特来自Instagram或其他平台"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16847.83, "timestamp": "04:40:47", "text": "有件事发生在我第一次见到你的时候……嗯……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16849.75, "timestamp": "04:40:49", "text": "我想应该是在你出道之前吧。我不知道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16852.708, "timestamp": "04:40:52", "text": "是的，我当时真的很高兴。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16855.03, "timestamp": "04:40:55", "text": "我的天啊。一位印度 YouTuber"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16857.99, "timestamp": "04:40:57", "text": "实际上有一个类似原